INSERT INTO `about_products` (`id`, `product_id`, `images`, `heading`, `subheading`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(1, 1, '\"[\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767078550_pd2.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767078550_pd3.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767078550_pd4.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767078550_pd5.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767088883_pd1.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767088886_pd1.png\\\"]\"', 'Trigno Centro', 'About The Product', '<p>Created from over 30 years of experience and close collaboration with the EMG research community, Trigno Centro represents an evolutionary leap at the heart of our product ecosystem.</p><p>Engineered to deliver uncompromising signal quality, Trigno Centro provides a powerful, centralized platform for acquiring and synchronizing high-fidelity biosignals. Its modular architecture supports a wide range of sensors and experimental configurations, enabling seamless adaptation across human movement science, engineering, and neurophysiology applications..</p><p>With advanced data integrity, low latency performance, and robust scalability, Trigno Centro empowers researchers to design complex experiments with confidence. Whether capturing subtle neuromuscular activity or integrating multimodal data streams, the system ensures precision without sacrificing flexibility.</p>', '2025-12-30 06:52:58', '2025-12-30 10:01:26'),
(2, 2, '\"[\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767268081_1.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767268081_2.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767268081_3.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/images\\\\\\/1767268081_4.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767270593_videoplayback.mp4\\\"]\"', 'Valkyrie', 'A dynamic camera for a changing a world', '<p>A dynamic camera for a changing a world valkyrie is the new foundation of your motion capture system. Agilty , speed and raw power are precision - engineered into every detail. vicon created the from the ground up based on the invaluable feedback of our global community, valkyrie builds on more than four decades of vicon experties to fit seaamlessly into our for biomechanists , for sports science practitioners, for engineering, for users whose applications haven\'t even been imagined yet , valkyrie is the tool that will expand your&nbsp; conception of what motion capture can do.&nbsp;</p>', '2025-12-30 12:35:39', '2026-01-01 12:29:53'),
(3, 6, '\"[\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767378853_vero.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767378940_Vero R-Lateral.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767378940_Vero L - Lateral.png\\\"]\"', 'Vero', 'Engineered for Ultra-Accurate Motion Analysis', '<p>The <strong>Vero Camera</strong> is a dynamic motion capture camera designed for a rapidly changing world. It delivers exceptional accuracy and high-speed performance for advanced motion analysis applications. High-resolution global shutter sensors capture fast and complex movements with outstanding clarity. Advanced grayscale processing ensures reliable marker detection even in demanding environments. Vero performs consistently in high marker density setups and large capture volumes. Precise synchronization and low latency provide repeatable, research-grade results. The camera integrates seamlessly with modern motion capture software platforms. Its flexible design supports clinical, sports, and biomechanics workflows. Robust engineering ensures long-term stability and dependable operation. <strong>Vero Camera enables confident, data-driven decisions through precise motion capture</strong></p>', '2026-01-02 18:34:13', '2026-01-02 18:35:40'),
(4, 7, '\"[\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767509468_Gold and Beige Elegant Jewellery Sale Instagram Post-4.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767509468_Gold and Beige Elegant Jewellery Sale Instagram Post-3.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767509742_Gold and Beige Elegant Jewellery Sale Instagram Post-5.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767509917_Gold and Beige Elegant Jewellery Sale Instagram Post-6.png\\\"]\"', 'Bob-Biomechanics Software', 'Intelligent Biomechanical Modeling', '<p>BoB (Biomechanics of Bodies) is a powerful biomechanical modelling software suite for human movement analysis. It combines an advanced musculoskeletal human model with an intuitive, easy-to-use interface. The software enables detailed analysis of kinematics, kinetics, and muscle forces. Motion capture data is transformed into quantitative, objective biomechanical information. BoB supports applications in clinical research, sports performance, ergonomics, and engineering. Its robust analysis tools help evaluate joint loading and movement efficiency. The platform integrates seamlessly with leading motion capture systems. Subject-specific models can be created for higher accuracy. Clear visualizations simplify interpretation of complex data. BoB empowers researchers and clinicians with reliable, evidence-based insights.</p>', '2026-01-04 06:51:08', '2026-01-04 06:58:37'),
(5, 8, '\"[\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767595617_Multi Axis Load cells-2.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767595617_Multi Axis Load cells-3.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767595617_Multi Axis Load cells-4.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767595617_Multi Axis Load cells-5.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767595617_Multi Axis Load cells-6.png\\\",\\\"products\\\\\\/about\\\\\\/media\\\\\\/1767595617_Multi Axis Load cells-7.png\\\"]\"', 'Multi Axis Force & Torque sensor', 'Measure Every Direction Precisely', '<p>The Multi-Axis Force &amp; Torque Sensor is a high-precision device designed to measure forces and torques along multiple axes simultaneously. It delivers accurate, real-time data, making it ideal for applications in robotics, automotive testing, aerospace, and industrial automation. Its compact and robust construction ensures reliable performance even under dynamic and challenging conditions. Advanced signal processing allows for repeatable and consistent measurements, while seamless integration with data acquisition systems simplifies testing and analysis. This sensor empowers engineers and researchers to gain detailed insights into complex load interactions, optimize designs, and make informed, data-driven decisions with confidence.</p>', '2026-01-04 09:27:33', '2026-01-05 06:46:57');

